OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785887271
OL,3,CSuspect due in court after Scottish
OL,4,Cwoman's body found in suitcase in
OL,5,CGreece
OL,7,FA man accused of killing a Scottish
OL,8,Fwoman and disposing of her body in a
OL,9,Fsuitcase in Athens is due to appear
OL,10,Fbefore a Greek court.
OL,12,FThe woman, who has been identified as
OL,13,F38-year-old Elisabeth-Jane Ross ` also
OL,14,Fknown as Lisa ` was discovered by a
OL,15,Fhomeless man in a derelict building in
OL,16,Fthe Kypseli area of Athens on July 18.
OL,18,FThe suspect is widely reported to be
OL,19,FSharif Ahmadzai, 26, an Afghan boxer
OL,20,Fwho left his home country after being
OL,21,Forphaned as a teenager.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785887271
OL,3,CSuspect due in court after Scottish
OL,4,Cwoman's body found in suitcase in
OL,5,CGreece
OL,7,FThe authorities have not publicly
OL,8,Fconfirmed his identity.
OL,10,FThe 26-year-old, who was initially
OL,11,Fdetained on illegal weapons possession
OL,12,Fcharges, is facing a murder charge as
OL,13,Fwell as allegations that he stole more
OL,14,Fthan 10,000 euro from the victim's
OL,15,Fbank accounts using her bank cards,
OL,16,Fpolice said.
OL,18,FGreek officials said he admitted
OL,19,Fmoving the body, but denied the murder
OL,20,Fallegations.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
