FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785887271
OL,3,CSuspect due in court after Scottish
OL,4,Cwoman's body found in suitcase in
OL,5,CGreece
OL,7,FPolice said the suspect was detained
OL,8,Ffor questioning after investigators
OL,9,Freviewed surveillance camera footage
OL,10,Frecorded near the abandoned building.
OL,12,FAfter allegedly murdering Ms Ross,
OL,13,FAhmadzai is accused of sending a
OL,14,Fseries of messages from her phone to
OL,15,Fher friends and family before
OL,16,Fswitching off the device.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785887271
OL,3,CSuspect due in court after Scottish
OL,4,Cwoman's body found in suitcase in
OL,5,CGreece
OL,7,FHe is then said to have bought another
OL,8,Fphone and texted her friends in
OL,9,FAthens, including his wife,
OL,10,Fimpersonating an unnamed jihadist
OL,11,Fsaying he had killed the Scot because
OL,12,Fof her religion, Greek newspapers
OL,13,FProto Thema and Ta Nea reported.
OL,15,FThe newspapers reported that his wife,
OL,16,Fa US citizen named Alaina Hall, told
OL,17,Fthe police that she suspected her
OL,18,Fhusband's involvement in the murder
OL,19,Fwhen she woke up to find he was not in
OL,20,Ftheir apartment and tracked his phone
OL,21,Fto where Ms Ross was staying.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785887271
OL,3,CSuspect due in court after Scottish
OL,4,Cwoman's body found in suitcase in
OL,5,CGreece
OL,7,FMs Ross is believed to have died
OL,8,Fbetween five and seven days before she
OL,9,Fwas found, during a heatwave in which
OL,10,Ftemperatures reached 36C.
OL,12,FThe Hellenic Police, Greece's national
OL,13,Fforce, were able to identify her using
OL,14,Ffingerprints.
OL,16,FMs Ross, who is understood to be from
OL,17,FEdinburgh, entered Greece on June 26
OL,18,Fand was initially staying with friends
OL,19,Fin Piraeus, a port area of Athens.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785887271
OL,3,CSuspect due in court after Scottish
OL,4,Cwoman's body found in suitcase in
OL,5,CGreece
OL,7,FShe is then said to have gone to meet
OL,8,FAmerican friends in another part of
OL,9,Fthe Greek capital, but it is unclear
OL,10,Fif this ever happened.
OL,12,FAuthorities are awaiting the results
OL,13,Fof tissue analysis to determine
OL,14,Fwhether she died from suffocation, as
OL,15,Fsuggested by a preliminary assessment
OL,16,Fby the medical examiner.
OL,18,FThe Foreign and Commonwealth Office
OL,19,Fsaid earlier: "Our thoughts are with
OL,20,FElisabeth's family during this
OL,21,Fdifficult time.
OL,26,@{D@OOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/7
