PN,30207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785887271
OL,3,CSuspect due in court after Scottish
OL,4,Cwoman's body found in suitcase in
OL,5,CGreece
OL,7,F"We are providing consular support and
OL,8,Fare in contact with the local
OL,9,Fauthorities."
OL,11,FA Police Scotland spokesperson
OL,12,Fpreviously said: "We are aware of the
OL,13,Fdeath of a Scottish woman in Athens
OL,14,Fand are liaising with authorities in
OL,15,FGreece.
OL,17,F"Officers are providing support to her
OL,18,Ffamily in Scotland."
